}{20}$ on the right.\n\n![](images/b1/b129b90d78fb67dc217534e10db45b5bccc4bea5094bb9242d14e89528b2c891.png)\n\nThe division operation splits each vertical line into $5$ equal parts. So the shaded parts on the left are $5$ times larger than the shaded parts on the right.  \n\nTherefore, the division problem shown is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{4}÷5=\\frac{2}{20}.\n$$\n\nSo, the missing number is $5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a12a446b-70fa-5ca6-8124-84697e8be777"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a12a446b-70fa-5ca6-8124-84697e8be777" :answer-field/id #uuid "a12a446b-70fa-5ca6-8124-84697e8be777" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-cdef3f59-c1d3-5532-84ca-68e3d0565585" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e3d6b8f8-66eb-5d0d-80c7-64feb83dbe91" "answer-eb992a7d-16d0-55c6-b707-a00b90e418b9" "answer-54ae19d2-a3fd-5736-ab87-f0397b23f687" "answer-cdef3f59-c1d3-5532-84ca-68e3d0565585" "answer-a6f864cb-46d0-535f-8248-d436988982b2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e3d6b8f8-66eb-5d0d-80c7-64feb83dbe91" :answer/id #uuid "e3d6b8f8-66eb-5d0d-80c7-64feb83dbe91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eb992a7d-16d0-55c6-b707-a00b90e418b9" :answer/id #uuid "eb992a7d-16d0-55c6-b707-a00b90e418b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-54ae19d2-a3fd-5736-ab87-f0397b23f687" :answer/id #uuid "54ae19d2-a3fd-5736-ab87-f0397b23f687" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cdef3f59-c1d3-5532-84ca-68e3d0565585" :answer/id #uuid "cdef3f59-c1d3-5532-84ca-68e3d0565585" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a6f864cb-46d0-535f-8248-d436988982b2" :answer/id #uuid "a6f864cb-46d0-535f-8248-d436988982b2" :answer/type :answe